:::cell {header="true" scope="col"}
Header field
:::
:::cell {header="true" scope="col"}
Policy
:::
:::
:::row
:::cell
`alg`
:::
:::cell
must be `ES256` (EdDSA reserved for future profile work)
:::
:::
:::row
:::cell
`crit`
:::
:::cell
must be absent or empty array; non-empty rejected
:::
:::
:::row
:::cell
`jwk`/`jku`/`x5u`/`x5c`/`x5t`
:::
:::cell
rejected (trust is host-bound, not header-bound)
:::
